//Cheats/Enable Debug Moderess Press buttons while in certain game modes to enable extra functionalities: Holding Select while entering the main menu will unlock all menu options.Holding Select while entering the Bonus menu will unlock everything in it.Holding Select while entering Free Battle will unlock all characters.Holding Select while changing into a ADV mode such as New Game will open an event select menu.Holding Start while changing into a ADV mode such as New Game will send you into battle mode.Holding R1 while entering battle mode will skip all cinematics.Pressing L2 + Start in battle mode will make a CG image appear on-screen and unlock them. This will also skip to your turn.Pressing L2 + Select in battle mode will draw all walkable tiles on-screen at once.Pressing L2 + Square in battle mode will change the selected character's costume.Pressing L2 + X in battle mode will rotate the selected character.Pressing L2 + Triangle in battle mode will cycle through character animations.Pressing L2 + R2 in battle mode will set the selected character's stats to 99.Pressing L2 + D-Pad Down / Up in the battle preparation menu will increase or decrease debug numbers in the lower right of the screen. It's not clear what these represent.Pressing L2 + Triangle in the battle preparation menu will unlock all weapons and armor
patch=1,EE,204FBA88,extended,00000001